  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/particledecay/kconf/zipball/v2.0.0",
  "body": "## Breaking Changes\n\nThe logic for checking context/cluster/user comparisons in configs was changed (before: slightly broken, after: more deterministic), and so may break previous functionality. This is used to deconflict kubeconfig definitions and perform renames.\n\n## What's Changed\n\n* fix(build): update conform branch in build config by @particledecay in [#53](https://github.com/particledecay/kconf/pull/53)\n* fix(build): update coverage workflow by @particledecay in [#54](https://github.com/particledecay/kconf/pull/54)\n* refactor: switch from Ginkgo to stdlib testing by @particledecay in [#57](https://github.com/particledecay/kconf/pull/57)\n* feat: add makefile and switch to codacy by @particledecay in [#60](https://github.com/particledecay/kconf/pull/60)\n* fix: updates how the context name is chosen when adding new contexts.… by @scottnemes in [#58](https://github.com/particledecay/kconf/pull/58)\n\n## New Contributors\n\n* @scottnemes made their first contribution in [#58](https://github.com/particledecay/kconf/pull/58)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/particledecay/kconf/compare/v1.12.0...v2.0.0\n",
  "mentions_count": 2
}
